@GAME_TITLE@  -  version @PROJECT_VERSION@
==================================================

A fast, glowing vector-arcade shooter. Steer your ship through drifting rocks, blast them into
smaller and smaller pieces, dodge the flying saucers and chase a place in the top 10.

Run @GAME_FILE_NAME@.exe. No installation needed; keep the "shaders" folder next to the .exe.


CONTROLS
--------
                   Keyboard                  Gamepad (Xbox / PlayStation / Switch)
  Rotate           A / D  or  Left / Right   left stick or d-pad
  Thrust           W  or  Up                 left stick up, right trigger or d-pad up
  Fire             Space                     A / Cross (bottom button) or right shoulder
  Hyperspace       Shift                     Y / Triangle (top button)
  Pause / menu     Esc  or  P                Start / Options / +
  Fullscreen       F11  or  Alt+Enter
  Mute             M                         View / Share / -

Menus: Up / Down to choose, Left / Right to change a value, Enter / Space (or A) to confirm,
Esc (or B) to go back. The game pauses by itself when its window loses focus.


RULES
-----
- You start with 3 ships and get an extra one every 10,000 points.
- Large rocks split into two medium ones, medium into two small ones.
  Points: large 20, medium 50, small 100.
- Flying saucers: the large one (200 points) fires anywhere, the small one (1000 points) aims at
  you, better and better as your score grows.
- After a crash your ship comes back in the middle and blinks for 3 seconds, untouchable.
- Clear the field to start the next wave, with one more large rock.
- Hyperspace jumps to a random spot. It may save you, or not.


OPTIONS AND SAVED FILES
-----------------------
Options (pause menu or title screen menu): master volume, effects volume, fullscreen, vsync,
screen shake, and the controls. Settings, the high score table and the log file are kept in your
user folder:
  Windows:  %APPDATA%\Ridejock\@GAME_FILE_NAME@\
            (settings.txt, highscores.txt, logs\@GAME_FILE_NAME@.log)
Delete highscores.txt to reset the table.

Needs Windows 10 or 11 and a graphics driver with Direct3D 12 or Vulkan support.


CREDITS
-------
Game, code, sound design and art: Ervin Ashley.
Every sound is synthesized by the game while it starts; there are no recordings.

Made with the Emerald engine (https://github.com/Ridejock/Emerald) on top of SDL3
(https://libsdl.org). Also uses spdlog, {fmt}, stb, dr_mp3 and nlohmann/json.
Font: Share Tech Mono by Carrois Type Design, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (assets/fonts/).

